  (text "Battery optional: one 1S Li-ion/LiPo cell from 250 mAh up, with a 10k NTC (103AT type) in the pack (3-wire JST PH: 1 -, 2 NTC, 3 +)."
    (at 20 380 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "db9c5f0d-b60b-618d-232c-97ea53d3feea"))
  (text "Three independent layers: charger (4.2 V, resistor-set current, 0-50 C window from the pack NTC, safety timer), BQ29700 + 2 FETs (OV 4.275 V, UV 2.8 V, OC about 2 A, short), 3 A fuse."
    (at 20 385 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "f9da030b-6ef0-91f0-caf2-f17a423944c5"))
  (text "Charge current: 0.25 A by hardware; firmware turns on Q5 (1.0 A) only for a cell of 1000 mAh or more as entered in setup. No NTC: no charging."
    (at 20 390 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "08a016d7-5e70-8db4-3e94-c217cfbffe6a"))
  (text "Input limit: 0.44 A by hardware; Q6 raises it to 1.39 A when CC_SENSE shows a 1.5 A or 3 A source."
    (at 20 395 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "5cbc8d78-56be-0879-e07a-02c3c2b431e5"))
  (text "Hold-up with no cell: VSYS 4.4 V down to 3.0 V gives the 0.5 F about 2.6 J, about 2 s at 1.2 W with the radio off."
    (at 20 400 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "aaea41f2-377f-85c6-089e-5b0ddc9254e7"))
  (text "PWR_FAIL_N goes low when VBUS falls below about 4.3 V. With a cell fitted the firmware keeps logging and watches VBAT_SENSE instead."
    (at 20 405 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "8474d91e-8733-1c53-27ef-368b21fd6cb3"))
  (text "On: press PWR, or plug in USB. The MCU then drives PWR_HOLD high. Off: long press (read on PWR_BTN), firmware releases PWR_HOLD."
    (at 20 410 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "0940ee33-6e76-5d16-2f1c-6720aa47ae09")))
